WEBVTT

00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:34.505
Every vote that we cast should be
against weapons of mass destruction,

00:10:34.546 --> 00:10:36.507
against automation of war.

00:10:36.548 --> 00:10:38.884
(Applause)

00:10:39.885 --> 00:10:42.638
And you can do something
in your own community.

00:10:42.638 --> 00:10:45.724
Right now, there are literally
millions of Afghans

00:10:45.724 --> 00:10:48.519
who are brutally forced
to leave their home.

00:10:49.436 --> 00:10:54.858
Like them, there are Syrians,
Iraqis, Burundians

00:10:54.858 --> 00:10:59.738
who all have to deal with the fallout
of war and displacement.